		<hr>

		<div class="texto-blog">					
		<p>In this article we will see <strong>How to create a map with Leaflet / OpenStreetMap</strong>, something similar to <strong>Google Maps</strong>, <a class="text-info" href="https://leafletjs.com/" target="_blank">Leaflet</a> is an opensource JavaScript library to create interactive maps on the web or mobile, which can be combined with extensions such as <strong>postgis</strong> to create dynamic maps with data from databases such as postgresql / mysql among others.</p>

		<h2>How to add Leaflet in Symfony 5?</h2>

		{{ include('inc/ad_defect.html.twig') }} 	
		
		<p>First we add the cdn in the style block with the use of templates <strong>twig</strong>, if you do not know how this template system works, check this article <a class="text-info" href="/twig-symfony">Twig templates</a>.</p>

		<div class="text-center">

		<img class="img-fluid" src="../assets/img/leaflet1.png" alt="leaflet1">

		</div>

		<p>We will add some labels <strong>for container use</strong>, we will use <strong>Bootstrap 4</strong> so that it covers 6 columns in the grid, the grid works with 12 columns, now we will point to the id of the map called <strong>mapid</strong>.</p>

		<div class="text-center">

		<img class="img-fluid" src="../assets/img/leaflet2.png" alt="leaflet2">

		</div>


		<p>As we see the library has several methods, we have the method <code>map('mapid')</code> where we will point to the id, <code>setView()</code> we will place some coordinates here, we can combine it with <strong>postgis</strong> to create maps with data from database or apis, but that is another story, we are interested in the method <code>openPopup()</code> if we put it after <strong>addTo(map)</strong> will load the popup on the map at once.</p>		

		<pre class="text-code">
		<code>	
     var map = L.map('mapid').
     setView([10.48801, -66.75919],
     15);

     L.tileLayer('http://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {
	attribution: 'Map data &copy; <a href="http://openstreetmap.org">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors, <a href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/">CC-BY-SA</a>, Imagery © <a href="http://cloudmade.com">CloudMade</a>',
	maxZoom: 18
	}).addTo(map);

     L.control.scale().addTo(map);    

     L.marker([10.48801, -66.75919],{draggable: true}).bindPopup("<b>OpenGisCRM</b><br>Programación.").addTo(map).openPopup();
		</code>
		</pre>

		<p>Result loading the popup.</p>

		<div class="text-center">

		<img class="img-fluid" src="../assets/img/leaflet3.png" alt="leaflet3">

		</div>

		<p>If we put the method <code>openPopup()</code> before adding it to the map <strong>addTo(map)</strong>, it will only be shown when you click with the mouse.</p>

		<pre class="text-code">
		<code>
     var map = L.map('mapid').
     setView([10.48801, -66.75919],
     15);

     L.tileLayer('http://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {
	attribution: 'Map data &copy; <a href="http://openstreetmap.org">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors, <a href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/">CC-BY-SA</a>, Imagery © <a href="http://cloudmade.com">CloudMade</a>',
	maxZoom: 18
	}).addTo(map);

     L.control.scale().addTo(map);
    

     L.marker([10.48801, -66.75919],{draggable: true}).bindPopup("<b>OpenGisCRM</b><br>Programación.").openPopup().addTo(map);
		</code>
		</pre>

		<p>Result loading the map, only the popup appears when you click.</p>

		<div class="text-center">

		<img class="img-fluid" src="../assets/img/leaflet4.png" alt="leaflet4">

		</div>

		<p>If we want to add a circle we will use the method <code>circle()</code> with its coordinates.</p>

		<pre class="text-code">
		<code>
     var map = L.map('mapid').
     setView([10.48801, -66.75919],
     15);

     L.tileLayer('http://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {
	attribution: 'Map data &copy; <a href="http://openstreetmap.org">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors, <a href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/">CC-BY-SA</a>, Imagery © <a href="http://cloudmade.com">CloudMade</a>',
	maxZoom: 18
	}).addTo(map);

     L.control.scale().addTo(map);
    

     L.marker([10.48801, -66.75919],{draggable: true}).bindPopup("<b>OpenGisCRM</b><br>Programación.").addTo(map).openPopup();
  

     var circle = L.circle([10.48801, -66.75919], {
     color: 'red',
     fillColor: '#f03',
     fillOpacity: 0.5,
     radius: 500
	 }).addTo(map);

		</code>
		</pre>

		<p>Result loading the map.</p>

		<div class="text-center">

		<img class="img-fluid" src="../assets/img/leaflet5.png" alt="leaflet5">

		</div>

